to charge customer for amount
    given customer is a CustomerId
    given amount is a Money
    produces a Receipt
    can fail with Declined
    uses payments
    expect amount ≤ limit of customer
    ensure on success, total_charged_to customer = total_charged_to customer at entry + amount
    ensure on failure, total_charged_to customer = total_charged_to customer at entry
    changes only balance of customer, charges of customer
    example charge alice for 10 is receipt_for 10
